+  lifecycle: active
+  files: [".github/workflows/unwired-gate.yml", scripts/unwired-gate-check.mjs, src/lib/ci-parity.ts]
+  fact: >-
+    Before opening a PR that adds or changes a gate-shaped script, npm check script, or its CI
+    registration, run `npm run --silent unwired-gate:check` on the proposed tree. The check reads
+    parsed workflow steps and package.json script calls; register each gate in an executable
+    workflow or package script, and remove stale allowance rows when wiring lands. This is the
+    local check for the unwired-gate refusal, not a textual mention or a unit test of the checker.
+  evidence: >-
+    The unwired-gate gate refused pull requests #10137, #10215, and #10271, and each was repaired.
+    `scripts/unwired-gate-check.mjs` reports gate-shaped scripts that no workflow or package script
+    invokes, plus stale allowances; `.github/workflows/unwired-gate.yml` runs the checker. The
+    individual refusal logs were not available to establish a narrower shared cause.
+  src: "ci-learning:10137:unwired-gate"
